{
  "id": "case-gold-chase-fail-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Chasing the Spike",
    "bn": "Spike-এর পিছনে ছোটা"
  },
  "symbol": "XAUUSD",
  "timeframe": "H1",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bullish",
  "outcome": "loss",
  "tags": [
    "case-study",
    "gold",
    "chasing"
  ],
  "module": "17-case-studies-trade-reviews",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "02-famous-gold-move-analysis"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Same reconstruction. Buying at 2347.36 just after the spike, stop 12 points below, is stopped on the pullback, and then price rises further without the trader.",
    "bn": "একই পুনর্গঠন। Spike-এর ঠিক পরে 2347.36-এ buy, 12 পয়েন্ট নিচে stop, pullback-এ stop খায়; তারপর দাম আরও ওঠে, trader ছাড়াই।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "Chasing after a shock puts the entry at the worst price for the stop, and normal pullbacks hit it.",
    "bn": "ধাক্কার পর ধাওয়ায় entry stop-এর জন্য সবচেয়ে খারাপ দামে পড়ে, স্বাভাবিক pullback-ই তা ছুঁয়ে ফেলে।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "Being right about the direction is not enough; the entry price matters",
      "bn": "দিক ঠিক হওয়া যথেষ্ট নয়; entry-র দামও গুরুত্বপূর্ণ"
    }
  ],
